  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "There will be only vertically downward force on the curved surface of the cone applied by liquid as the horizontal force will be cancelled.<br />Let this force is equal to F<br />Buoyancy force = <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>H</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi></math><br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
